# timeline-svc

Activity feed API for timeline-svc.

GET /feed returns events newest first, a page at a time. Pass the next cursor from one page to get the following page. Cursors are opaque.

## Page size

limit is clamped to 1 to 100. A missing, zero or non-numeric limit means the default page of 20.
# Changelog

## 1.3.0

- Feed and comments share one keyset pager.
- Feed cursors are base64url tokens.
- The feed limit is clamped to 1 to 100.

## 1.2.0

- Cursor pagination for the feed and for comments.
